</style><h2>Blinky 1.5.29</h2><ul><li><strong>「Token 消耗」不再一直停在其他窗口前面。</strong> 从用量卡片打开「Token 消耗」后，点到别的窗口，这一窗口会退到后面。<a href="https://github.com/harrisliangsu/blinky-mac/pull/91">#91</a></li><li><strong>「输出速度」的列表更紧凑。</strong> 「Token 消耗」窗口仍以 tok/s 列出所选统计区间的平均速度和每个已计时模型的速度，日志里有首字时间时写在该模型下面，每一行比设置里的一行更矮。<a href="https://github.com/harrisliangsu/blinky-mac/pull/91">#91</a></li></ul><p><a href="https://github.com/harrisliangsu/blinky-mac/releases/tag/v1.5.29">在 GitHub 查看更新说明</a></p>]]></description>
            <description xml:lang="en"><![CDATA[<style>
  h2 { font-size: 1.05em; margin: 0 0 .5em; }
  ul { margin: 0; padding-left: 1.2em; }
  li { margin: .3em 0; }
  p { margin: .8em 0 0; }
</style><h2>Blinky 1.5.29</h2><ul><li><strong>The Token spend window no longer stays in front of other apps.</strong> With Token spend open from the usage card, clicking another window brings that window forward and leaves this one behind it. <a href="https://github.com/harrisliangsu/blinky-mac/pull/91">#91</a></li><li><strong>Output speed uses a shorter list.</strong> The Token spend window still shows the selected span&#x27;s average and each timed model&#x27;s speed in tok/s, with first-token latency under that model when a log recorded it, and each row is shorter than a settings row. <a href="https://github.com/harrisliangsu/blinky-mac/pull/91">#91</a></li></ul><p><a href="https://github.com/harrisliangsu/blinky-mac/releases/tag/v1.5.29">Release notes on GitHub</a></p>]]></description>
